ile Antonio has focused on his work, so much so that he is now a well-known chef in a pastry shop. It is clear that there is still a special relationship between the two, but Antonio mistakes Luca's affection for something more and does everything he can to ruin his relationship with Tancredi, even though Cristina does not approve of his behavior. Will Antonio learn to leave the past behind in order to fully experience what the future has to offer him?"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9X39VDcF12lb3vp0dTdfyoCbH8k.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7J1HPf64OTqxLMUhFxrKmv3SOyR.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":1224447,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"it-IT","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9X39VDcF12lb3vp0dTdfyoCbH8k.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9X39VDcF12lb3vp0dTdfyoCbH8k.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9X39VDcF12lb3vp0dTdfyoCbH8k.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9X39VDcF12lb3vp0dTdfyoCbH8k.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tFY6lZL37hqINnZAvHo6CdEGTMy.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tFY6lZL37hqINnZAvHo6CdEGTMy.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yn4oEbZSKQoHDt4qpFZX0NuwceM.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yn4oEbZSKQoHDt4qpFZX0NuwceM.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jqmUFYmTWfSep1HL7eGaLJHq1aR.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jqmUFYmTWfSep1HL7eGaLJHq1aR.jpg","language":"it","width":853,"height":1280},{"type":"poster","url":"https://ima